  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Balasubramanian vs State Represented By Its on 10 December, 2024 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 10.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P(MD)No.7003 of 2022 and Crl.M.P(MD)No.4805 of 2022 1. Balasubramanian 2. Alagarsamy ... Peti Vs State represented by its The Food Safety Officer, Marungapuri and Vaiyampatti Circle, No.312, DDHS Office Complex, Trichy District. ... Respo PRAYER: Criminal Original petitions have been filed under Sections (1) (b) of the Code of Criminal Procedure, to call for the entire r relating to the proceeding in S.T.C No.146 of 2022 on the file of t Judicial Magistrate, Manaparai and quash the same as illegal. For Petitioners : Mr.Madhu J, For Respondent :Mr.B.Thanga Aravindh Government Advocate (Crl.Side) https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ORDER This petition has been filed challenging the proceedin Balasubramanian vs State Represented By Its on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/179496894/ 1 No.146 of 2022, on the file of the learned Judicial Magistrate, Man for the offence under Sections 51 and 59(i) of Food safety and Stan Act, 2006.",
